  "review_summary": {
    "proposed_schema_summary": "Define a new certificate record type with its own certificate identity and type flags, an exact source E_case record and receipt reference, provenance and transaction authority, an optional separately pinned Checker decision reference, and explicit false Checker-promotion-evidence-sufficiency-CERTIFIED_STOP-SI-L2 assertions.",
